# Server-side backups: deploy/backup.sh writes its tarballs to backups/ INSIDE the deploy
# checkout on the prod box, and the image build runs there with the checkout as its context.
# Without this exclusion the context balloons by ~2x the appdata volume (tens of GB) and
# COPY . . fills the disk. Nothing in the image needs them.
backups
